   "answer": "Per the Operator Manual (\u00a74.3), before starting the HPU: (1) Hydraulic fluid level is within the normal band on the sight glass. (2) Isolation valve IV-21 is OPEN. (3) emergency stop circuit is RESET. (4) Maintenance access panel must be installed (do not start with it removed)."
  },
